"description":"Vehicle Maintenance Tracker (VMT) is a simple yet powerful tool designed to help you keep a complete history of your vehicles’ maintenance. Whether you're tracking a single car or managing a fleet, VMT makes it easy to stay organized and informed.\n\nKey Features:\n*Add and update vehicle details, including photo, VIN, license plate, year, make, model, tire size, oil filter type, current odometer, and annual maintenance costs.\n*Set, view, and reset due dates for upcoming services.\n*Archive vehicles you no longer own and restore or permanently delete them at any time.\n*Manage maintenance records for multiple vehicles—oil changes, brakes, tires, batteries, and more.\n*Attach photos of maintenance receipts for better documentation.\n*Search and filter maintenance records easily.\n*Maintenance entries are organized and sorted chronologically for quick reference.\n*Export or email vehicle data in CSV format for printing or sharing.\n\nI hope you enjoy using VMT as much as I enjoyed building it. If you have any questions, feedback, or suggestions, feel free to reach out—and don't forget to join the **VMT community on Facebook**! It's the best way to connect with me and other users, get updates, and suggest new features.\n\nHappy Tracking!", "minimumOsVersion":"12.2", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.37685000000000012931877790833823382854461669921875, "sellerUrl":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/VehicleMaintenanceTracker", "languageCodesISO2A":[], "fileSizeBytes":"62502912", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":2842, "trackContentRating":"4+", "bundleId":"nmsolution.com", "averageUserRating":4.37685000000000012931877790833823382854461669921875, "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "trackCensoredName":"Vehicle Maintenance Tracker", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/vehicle-maintenance-tracker/id1315913699?uo=4", "releaseDate":"2017-11-28T05:07:23Z", "price":0.00, "sellerName":"Hai Nguyen", "userRatingCount":2842}]
